    <marc:datafield tag="520" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
      <marc:subfield code="a">Transform your kitchen table into a battle ground with working mini models of historic battle machines. Make your own medieval battlements and towers, then prepare to defend your castle with mini-launchers and siege engines. Get ready to trick your friends with sneaky traps and triggers. You can make: a spring-armed catapult, a medieval siege tower, a ninja throwing star, a marshmallow trigger, and much more! All you need are some simple household items. Mini Battles is packed with fun illustrations, clear step-by-step instructions and helpful tips. What&apos;s more, each project comes with bitesize facts explaining how the weapons and defences were used through the ages. So, what are you waiting for? Let battle commence!</marc:subfield>
